ed.","start":23.722,"end":28.58,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-004","sourceId":"b3-002-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The big clock which used to strike the hours day and night was damaged many years ago and has been silent ever since.","start":29.65,"end":38.24,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-005","sourceId":"b3-002-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"One night, however, our vicar woke up with a start:the clock was striking the hours!","start":39.7,"end":46.44,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-006","sourceId":"b3-002-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Looking at his watch, he saw that it was one o'clock, but the bell struck thirteen times before it stopped.","start":47.69,"end":55.32,"score":0.944,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-007","sourceId":"b3-002-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Armed with a torch, the vicar went up into the clock tower to see what was going on.","start":56.68,"end":62.38,"score":0.959,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-008","sourceId":"b3-002-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In the torchlight, he caught sight of a figure whom he immediately recognized as Bill Wilkins, our local grocer.","start":63.49,"end":71.87,"score":0.938,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-009","sourceId":"b3-002-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Whatever are you doing up here Bill?'","start":73.54,"end":75.53,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b3-002-010","sourceId":"b3-002-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"asked the vicar in surprise.","start":75.82,"end":77.32,"score":0.992,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-011","sourceId":"b3-002-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'I'm trying to repair the bell, ' answered Bill.","start":78.58,"end":81.47,"score":0.79,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-012","sourceId":"b3-002-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'I've been coming up here night after night for weeks now.","start":82.19,"end":85.48,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b3-002-013","sourceId":"b3-002-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"You see, I was hoping to give you a surprise.'","start":85.94,"end":88.75,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-014","sourceId":"b3-002-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'You certainly did give me a surprise!'","start":90.22,"end":92.463,"score":0.968,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-015","sourceId":"b3-002-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,3],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"said the vicar.","start":92.463,"end":93.17,"score":0.903,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["waveform-corrected-needs-listening"]},{"id":"b3-002-016","text":"'You've probably woken up everyone in the village as well.","start":93.85,"end":96.922,"score":0.93,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"sourceId":"b3-002-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"legacy-review","reviewReasons":["unresolved-word-alignment","waveform-corrected-needs-listening"]},{"id":"b3-002-017","sourceId":"b3-002-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Still, I'm glad the bell is working again.'","start":97.77,"end":101.14,"score":0.916,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-018","sourceId":"b3-002-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'That's the trouble, vicar, 'answered Bill.","start":102.33,"end":104.43,"score":0.856,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-019","sourceId":"b3-002-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,24],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'It's working all right, but I'm afraid that at one o'clock it will strike thirteen times and there's nothing I can do about it.'","start":105.1,"end":113.34,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b3-002-020","sourceId":"b3-002-020","sourceIndex":19,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'We'll get used to that, Bill, 'said the vicar.","start":114.95,"end":117.1,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b3-002-021","sourceId":"b3-002-021","sourceIndex":20,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Thirteen is not as good as one, but it's better than nothing.","start":117.75,"end":121.46,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-002-022","sourceId":"b3-002-022","sourceIndex":21,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Now let's go downstairs and have a cup of tea.'","start":122.21,"end":124.76,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]}]}
